       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BATRC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RC             PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-RC
           MOVE WS-RC TO RETURN-CODE
           DISPLAY 'BATRC RETURN CODE = 0000'
           STOP RUN.
